Version 4
SHEET 1 7000 5000
RECTANGLE Normal 0 0 3000 900 2
TEXT 16 40 Left 3 ;1  POWER INPUT + DC LINK: AS150 anti-spark connector, 16 x 150 µF polymer + 10 x 2.2 µF ceramic, bus and NTC sense
TEXT 16 876 Left 2 ;J1 (Battery input, anti-spark): +=VBUS, -=GND
RECTANGLE Normal 0 1000 3000 2500 2
TEXT 16 1040 Left 3 ;2  ESC AUX SUPPLY 12 V / 0.3 A  (U1 LTC7801, 440 kHz): gate drivers + logic. Each ESC makes its own (topology 07 lesson)
RECTANGLE Normal 3100 1000 4600 2500 2
TEXT 3116 1040 Left 3 ;3  LOGIC SUPPLIES: U2 LT1763-5 (sensors, encoder), U3 LT1763-3.3 (MCU)
TEXT 3116 2444 Left 2 ;C42 (LDO bypass, DO NOT FIT (10 nF lowers noise but slows start-up to several ms)): 1=+5V, 2=BYP5
TEXT 3116 2476 Left 2 ;C45 (LDO bypass, DO NOT FIT (10 nF lowers noise but slows start-up to several ms)): 1=+3V3, 2=BYP33
RECTANGLE Normal 0 2600 1550 4300 2
TEXT 16 2640 Left 3 ;4  LEG A: U4 LTC7063 150 V half-bridge driver (bootstrap) + 2 x 4 IPB065N15N3
RECTANGLE Normal 1600 2600 3150 4300 2
TEXT 1616 2640 Left 3 ;5  LEG B: U5 LTC7063 150 V half-bridge driver (bootstrap) + 2 x 4 IPB065N15N3
RECTANGLE Normal 3200 2600 4750 4300 2
TEXT 3216 2640 Left 3 ;6  LEG C: U6 LTC7063 150 V half-bridge driver (bootstrap) + 2 x 4 IPB065N15N3
RECTANGLE Normal 4700 1000 6700 2500 2
TEXT 4716 1040 Left 3 ;7  PHASE CURRENT: U7, U8 ACS770 ±200 A Hall sensors in phases A, B; 2/3 divider into the 3.3 V ADC
TEXT 4716 2444 Left 2 ;U7 (Hall current sensor phase A, ±200 A, 10 mV/A): IP+=PH_A, IP-=MOT_A, VCC=+5V, VIOUT=ACS_A, GND=GND
TEXT 4716 2476 Left 2 ;U8 (Hall current sensor phase B, ±200 A, 10 mV/A): IP+=PH_B, IP-=MOT_B, VCC=+5V, VIOUT=ACS_B, GND=GND
RECTANGLE Normal 4700 2600 6700 4300 2
TEXT 4716 2640 Left 3 ;8  MCU U9 STM32G431CBT6 (FOC firmware) + connectors.  In simulation: the behavioural FOC block below
TEXT 4716 4084 Left 2 ;U9 (MCU, Cortex-M4F 170 MHz (FOC)): PA8=PWM_A, PA9=PWM_B, PA10=PWM_C, PA0=ISNS_A, PA1=ISNS_B, PA2=VBUS_SNS, PA3=TEMP, PB0=DRV_EN, PB12=FAULT_N, PA4=ENC_CS, PA5=ENC_SCK, PA6=ENC_MISO, PA7=ENC_MOSI, PA15=SIG_IN, PB6=TLM_TX, PA13=SWDIO, PA14=SWCLK, PG10=NRST, PB8=BOOT0, VBAT=+3V3, PC13=LED, VDD=+3V3, VDDA=VDDA, VREF+=VDDA, VSS=GND, VSSA=GND
TEXT 4716 4116 Left 2 ;J2 (Motor phase A (8 mm bullet or solder pad)): 1=MOT_A
TEXT 4716 4148 Left 2 ;J3 (Motor phase B): 1=MOT_B
TEXT 4716 4180 Left 2 ;J4 (Motor phase C): 1=PH_C
TEXT 4716 4212 Left 2 ;J5 (Signal from flight controller (DShot in, telemetry out)): 1=SIG_EXT, 2=TLM_TX, 3=GND
TEXT 4716 4244 Left 2 ;J6 (Rotor encoder (AS5047P on the motor, SPI)): 1=+5V, 2=GND, 3=ENC_CS, 4=ENC_SCK, 5=ENC_MISO, 6=ENC_MOSI
TEXT 4716 4276 Left 2 ;J7 (SWD programming, Tag-Connect TC2030 pad order (6 = SWO, unused)): 1=+3V3, 2=SWDIO, 3=NRST, 4=SWCLK, 5=GND
RECTANGLE Normal 0 4400 3000 5100 2
TEXT 16 4440 Left 3 ;SIM: U15XL PMSM + prop (topology 09) on MOT_A / MOT_B / PH_C
RECTANGLE Normal 3100 4400 6700 5400 2
